{"resourceIdentifier":"4589","resourceName":"Biogas-based Manure Management Program","description":"The proposed project activity involves methane recovery through controlled anaerobic digestion of animal waste (cow dung) and utilization of recovered methane (biogas) for thermal energy and electricity generation in the dairy plant. The project plans to install two centralized anaerobic bio-digesters having capacities of 2000m3/day each, a total of 4000 m3/day and two number of 125KVA capacity biogas-based electrical engine.  The proposed plant will treat about 100 MT/day of animal manure per day sourced from nearby farmers or aggregators. The project is being built, and is owned and operated by Dudh Utpadak Sahakari Sangh Limited (DUSSL). Project activity is located at Chandauli district of Uttar Pradesh state in India.","location":{"latitude":25.239999,"longitude":83.060000},"inPublicCommentPeriod":false,"lastPublicCommentPeriod":{"startInclusive":"2023-08-22","endExclusive":"2023-09-22","endInclusive":"2023-09-21"},"attributes":[{"code":"PROJECT_ID","values":[{"type":"string","value":"4589"}]},{"code":"STATE_PROVINCE","values":[{"type":"string","value":"Uttar Pradesh"}]}],"participationSummaries":[{"programCode":"VCS","attributes":[{"code":"PROPONENT_NAME","values":[{"type":"string","value":"Dugdh Utpadak Sahkari Sangh Limited (DUSSL)"},{"type":"string","value":"Uttar Pradesh, India"}]},{"code":"PROJECT_STATUS","values":[{"type":"string","value":"Registered"}]},{"code":"EST_ANNUAL_EMISSION_REDCT","values":[{"type":"string","value":"11715"}]},{"code":"PRIMARY_PROJECT_CATEGORY_NAME","values":[{"type":"string","value":"Waste handling and disposal"}]},{"code":"PROTOCOL_NAME","values":[{"type":"string","value":"AMS-I.C.,AMS-III.D."}]},{"code":"VALIDATOR_NAME","values":[{"type":"string","value":"4K Earth Science Private Limited"}]},{"code":"PROJECT_REGISTRATION_DATE","values":[{"type":"string","value":"05/02/2025"}]},{"code":"CREDIT_PERIOD_INFO","values":[{"type":"strin